4.	Failure Count alert – 1.50$/month (Prod-SWA-Backend Failures and Auth Errors)
If there is any failure status like 400 and 500 errors
Frontend calling backend API but if backend Api not working as expected, this alert will trigger.

Using query:
dependencies
| where timestamp > ago(10m)
| where target contains "soc-watchtower-api.azure-api.net"
| extend statusCode = toint(resultCode)
| summarize
    backendFailures = countif(statusCode >= 500),
    authErrors = countif(statusCode in (401, 403))
| extend totalIssues = backendFailures + authErrors
 
Configured for 10min in dev but in prod it will 5min
